Changes (2026-10-28), by the Elder Souls: Argonia project, also under GPL-3.0-or-later:
- stream.html loads one extra script, argonia.js, before upstream's stream.js. Upstream's own
  files are otherwise the unmodified v3.0.1 release build.
- argonia.js (source: infra/stream-client/src in https://github.com/jtattersall09403/skyrim-argonia)
  adds an on-screen touch gamepad presented to the page as a standard Gamepad API pad,
  per-second stream metrics (round trip, jitter, loss, bitrate, frame rate, decode time, drops,
  resolution, codec, transport, device, network, input source) sent to a collector on the
  game machine, and press-to-screen latency measured from a host-drawn corner marker.

Corresponding source: upstream's at the tag above, plus infra/stream-client in this repository.
